that absolute difference between sum of numbers in each part is 1 (because the sum of all numbers is odd, then we can not improve the answer). To make this, we need to take in one group all numbers from 1 to ("},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"n"}],"kind":"emphasis"},{"kind":"text","text":" / 4 + 1), inclusively, and all last "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"n"}],"kind":"emphasis"},{"kind":"text","text":" / 4 numbers (i.e. numbers from ("},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"n"}],"kind":"emphasis"},{"kind":"text","text":" - "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"n"}],"kind":"emphasis"},{"kind":"text","text":" / 4 + 1) to "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"n"}],"kind":"emphasis"},{"kind":"text","text":", inclusively)."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"container"}],"kind":"container"}],"kind":"problem_section"},{"attrs":{"problemCode":"899D"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"attrs":{"href":"https://codeforces.com/contest/899/problem/D"},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"899D - Shovel Sale"}],"kind":"link"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"At first let's check that the sum "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"sum"}],"kind":"emphasis"},{"kind":"text","text":" = "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"n"}],"kind":"emphasis"},{"kind":"text","text":" + ("},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"n"}],"kind":"emphasis"},{"kind":"text","text":" - 1) consisting of only digits nine. If it is true then the answer is 1."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"In the other case, we should calculate the number of digits in the number "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"sum"}],"kind":"emphasis"},{"kind":"text","text":". Let this value if "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"len"}],"kind":"emphasis"},{"kind":"text","text":". We should construct the number "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"cur"}],"kind":"emphasis"},{"kind":"text","text":" which consisting of ("},{"children":[{"kind":"